── detail · GitLab ──
○ not set up: Add a tenancy: a GitLab group or repo whose merge requests to follow.

has     merge requests, repos, pipelines, jobs
opens   merge requests, repos, jobs on their own pages

OTHER PARTS CAN ADD
· chips on merge request rows
· chips on repo rows and page
· a column on merge request lists
· a column on the repositories middle pane
· a section on the merge request page and detail pane
· a tab on the merge request page
· a tab on the repo page
· actions on merge requests
· actions on repos
· actions on the job page
· a line on the merge request page, under its title
· a line on the repo page, under its title
· a mark on repo rows: the icon and where it is

GITLAB ADDS
· a Code tab, a code column and merge requests in the detail pane on tickets (once set up)
